{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\ndef solve(n, mod):\n    if n <= 3:\n        return 0\n    last_ans = 17\n    ans = 17\n    size = (n-1)*(n-2)//2 + 1\n    rec = [[0]*(size+1) for _ in range(2)]\n    rec[0][0:4] = [1,2,2,1]\n    toggle = 0\n    for m in range(4, n):\n        tp_size = m*(m-1)//2\n        ans = (m+1) * last_ans\n        tp = 0\n        cur = toggle ^ 1\n        for i in range(m):\n            tp += rec[cur][i]\n            rec[toggle][i] = tp % mod\n        for i in range(m, tp_size//2 + 1):\n            tp += rec[cur][i] - rec[cur][i-m]\n            rec[toggle][i] = tp % mod\n        for i in range(tp_size//2 + 1):\n            rec[toggle][tp_size - i] = rec[toggle][i]\n        total = 0\n        for i in range(tp_size - 1):\n            tp = 0\n            for j in range(max(1, -tp_size + i + m + 2), m+1):\n                tp += j * int(rec[toggle][m+2-j+i])\n            total += int(rec[toggle][i])\n            total %= mod\n            tp *= total\n            tp %= mod\n            ans += tp\n            ans %= mod\n        last_ans = ans\n        toggle ^= 1\n    return int(ans) % mod\n\ndef main():\n    n, mod = map(int, input().split())\n    print(solve(n, mod))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\nlong long solve(int n, long long mod) {\n    if (n <= 3) return 0;\n    long long last_ans = 17;\n    long long ans = 17;\n    long long size = (long long)(n-1)*(n-2)/2 + 1;\n    vector<vector<long long>> rec(2, vector<long long>(size+1, 0));\n    rec[0][0] = 1;\n    rec[0][1] = 2;\n    rec[0][2] = 2;\n    rec[0][3] = 1;\n    int toggle = 0;\n    for (int m = 4; m < n; ++m) {\n        long long tp_size = (long long)m*(m-1)/2;\n        ans = ((long long)(m+1) * last_ans) % mod;\n        int cur = toggle ^ 1;\n        long long tp = 0;\n        // first m elements\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; ++i) {\n            tp += rec[cur][i];\n            rec[toggle][i] = tp % mod;\n        }\n        // remaining up to tp_size/2\n        for (int i = m; i <= tp_size/2; ++i) {\n            tp += rec[cur][i] - rec[cur][i-m];\n            rec[toggle][i] = tp % mod;\n        }\n        // mirror\n        for (int i = 0; i <= tp_size/2; ++i) {\n            rec[toggle][tp_size - i] = rec[toggle][i];\n        }\n        long long total = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < tp_size - 1; ++i) {\n            long long tp2 = 0;\n            int start = max(1, -tp_size + i + m + 2);\n            for (int j = start; j <= m; ++j) {\n                tp2 += j * rec[toggle][m+2-j+i];\n            }\n            total = (total + rec[toggle][i]) % mod;\n            tp2 = (tp2 % mod) * total % mod;\n            ans = (ans + tp2) % mod;\n        }\n        last_ans = ans;\n        toggle ^= 1;\n    }\n    return ans % mod;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int n;\n    long long mod;\n    cin >> n >> mod;\n    cout << solve(n, mod) << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.629365427419543e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0004576589271891862, -0.00037079135654494166, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.014181784354150295, -1.4781842764932662e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -1.4066597032069694e-05, -0.3870488107204437, -0.023508286103606224, -3.564294092939235e-05, 0.0, -0.2519408166408539, -0.20460091531276703, 0.0, -0.00020930961181875318, -0.4740828573703766, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.003178665181621909, -8.344646857949556e-07, -4.541770613286644e-05, -6.806619057897478e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.2291887944447808e-05, -1.3351351299206726e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -7.152555099310121e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0011701886542141438, -0.02975539304316044, 0.0, 0.0, -0.25454181432724, -0.014163684099912643, -0.0007072569569572806, 0.0, -0.3142949640750885, -3.576272320060525e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, -0.005381027702242136, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.50339189733495e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.169585604860913e-05, -4.768360213347478e-06, -0.003034631721675396, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.77468371274881e-05, -1.8000440832111053e-05, -0.030227163806557655, -0.13022127747535706, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -0.0110483318567276, -2.622600959512056e-06, -0.029750879853963852, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -6.079655122448457e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.0024779110681265593, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -3.5523738915799186e-05, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0008099374244920909, -3.540453326422721e-05, -0.0031793781090527773, -7.486063259420916e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.00033539868309162557, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -2.384185506798530